<tr id="A5.T13.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T13.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span id="A5.T13.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T13.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.T13.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Question: Author David Chanoff has collaborated with a U.S. Navy admiral who served as the ambassador to the United Kingdom under which President?</span>
</span></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T13.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T13.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span id="A5.T13.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T13.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.T13.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Thought 1: I need to search David Chanoff, find the U.S. Navy admiral he collaborated with, then find the President under whom the admiral served as the ambassador to the United Kingdom.</span>
</span></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T13.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T13.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span id="A5.T13.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
