<span id="A5.T13.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.T13.p22.1" class="ltx_p">Judgment: The steps started with researching the dictator game, leading to a description of the game but not the developer. The follow-up search on the development of the game revealed Daniel Kahneman as the developer. The next logical step would be to determine Kahneman’s nationality. Kahneman is well-known in the field of psychology and economics, and finding his nationality from available biographical information is straightforward.</span>
</span></span></td></tr>
