<span id="A5.T13.p58" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.T13.p58.1" class="ltx_p">Judgment: The process to find the exact date of a WWE event that used the song "Justice" started with a search for the song itself, which did not directly yield relevant results. The link to the album "Cross" by Justice was established, but no connection to any specific WWE event was made. Further searches led to general information about WWE events, particularly the Royal Rumble, but did not provide specifics about the use of the song "Justice" at any WWE event. Without more precise or direct information linking the song to a specific event, determining the exact day remains highly uncertain.</span>
</span></span></td></tr>
