<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>Prompt to Generate Nodes</h3>

<figure id="A5.T17" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T17.2" class="ltx_tabular">
<tr id="A5.T17.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T17.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t"><span id="A5.T17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T17.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.T17.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Focus on the following erroneous results and thinking that have been obtained to avoid solving the problem as before.Use them to improve your strategy of correctly answering the given question.</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.T17.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.T17.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Results: error results, Thought: thought</span>
<span id="A5.T17.p3.2" class="ltx_p">…</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.T17.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.T17.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Based on other nodes on the same level and recent observations, you extract different key information, generate different thought, and thus generate different action.</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.T17.p4" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.T17.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Existing nodes:</span>
<span id="A5.T17.p4.2" class="ltx_p">Thought: thought</span>
</span></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T17.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T17.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T17.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T17.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Action: action</span>
</span></td></tr>
